## 7. Conclusion

FWR offers a unified ontological framework in which all existents are understood as Flow-Wave-Resonance subjects of equal ontological status. The framework provides a coherent structure for existence, truth, life, and crisis, expressed in simple mathematical formulations. It demonstrates explanatory reach across physics, psychology, AI alignment, ethics, and everyday experience. As an open form, FWR invites further development and application across disciplines.

In an era of ecological crisis, technological acceleration, and philosophical fragmentation, FWR proposes a return to relational thinking—a vision of existence as resonant participation rather than isolated domination.

